   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Venice AI · Text to image\n\nPick any of the ~45 Venice image models in **model**. Each entry shows price per image, **UNCENSORED/censored**, *private* and the model ID. ★ = your favourites (`Venice_AI_favourites.txt`).\n\n* **aspect_ratio / resolution / quality** only offer what the model supports.\n* Models without fixed ratios (Lustify, Chroma, SD 3.5 …) use width/height: pick a ratio, or *custom*.\n* **safe_mode** off = no blurring of adult content. **variants** 1–4 (each billed).\n* **prompt** output → saved as `.txt` next to the image.\n\nCheap & fast: Z-Image Turbo, Lustify, Chroma ($0.01). Top quality: GPT Image 2.5, Nano Banana Pro, Flux 3, Seedream V5 Pro.\n\nAll capabilities: [MODELS.md](https://github.com/Slartibart23/ComfyUI-Venice-AI-Nodes/blob/main/docs/MODELS.md)\n\n🇩🇪 Bild aus Text. Alle Fähigkeiten: [MODELS.de.md](https://github.com/Slartibart23/ComfyUI-Venice-AI-Nodes/blob/main/docs/MODELS.de.md)\n\n**API key:** put your Venice key into `Venice_AI_API.txt` in the ComfyUI folder (one line). Every run is billed to your Venice account.\n\n🇩🇪 Key in `Venice_AI_API.txt` im ComfyUI-Ordner. Jeder Lauf kostet Venice-Guthaben."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## Venice AI · Text to image\n\nPick any of the ~45 Venice image models in **model**. Each entry shows price per image, **UNCENSORED/censored**, *private* and the model ID. ★ = your favourites (`Venice_AI_favourites.txt`).\n\n* **aspect_ratio / resolution / quality** only offer what the model supports.\n* Models without fixed ratios (Lustify, Chroma, SD 3.5 …) use width/height: pick a ratio, or *custom*.\n* **safe_mode** off = no blurring of adult content. **variants** 1–4 (each billed).\n* **prompt** output → saved as `.txt` next to the image.\n\nCheap & fast: Z-Image Turbo, Lustify, Chroma ($0.01). Top quality: GPT Image 2.5, Nano Banana Pro, Flux 3, Seedream V5 Pro.\n\nAll capabilities: [MODELS.md](https://github.com/Slartibart23/ComfyUI-Venice-AI-Nodes/blob/main/docs/MODELS.md)\n\n🇩🇪 Bild aus Text. Alle Fähigkeiten: [MODELS.de.md](https://github.com/Slartibart23/ComfyUI-Venice-AI-Nodes/blob/main/docs/MODELS.de.md)\n\n**API key:** put your Venice key into `Venice_AI_API.txt` in the ComfyUI folder (one line). Every run is billed to your Venice account.\n\n🇩🇪 Key in `Venice_AI_API.txt` im ComfyUI-Ordner. Jeder Lauf kostet Venice-Guthaben."
